# Runtime state. data/ledger/ holds the Ed25519 signing key and the live decision ledger —
# neither ever leaves this machine. data/klines/ is a regenerable market-data cache.
# data/demo/ IS committed: the README cites those numbers and `npm run numbers-check`
# verifies them, so a fresh clone must have them to verify itself.
data/*
!data/demo/

